<title>TURKEY: Turkey's 97/98 cotton output seen down.</title>
<headline>Turkey's 97/98 cotton output seen down.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's 1997/98 cotton output is expected to turn out to be about 750,000 tonnes, down from 1996/97 output of 792,414 tonnes, a senior trade bourse official said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
